&lt;li&gt;Act as a subject matter expert in the features, benefits and application of Smartsheet’s products and solutions; educating the customer in how we partner with them to evaluate our software effectively&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct product demonstrations and partner with cross functional teams, including Sales Engineers, Customer Success and internal Consulting, to support complex sales cycles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualify and prioritise strategic business (80%) while closing and upleveling transactional business (20%) to ensure a healthy pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate and up-to-date records in Salesforce leveraging MEDDICC qualification guidelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop detailed strategic account plans aimed at growing Smartsheet footprint across enterprise business units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilise channel partner network where appropriate to gain customer traction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pipeline manage and forecast to exceed quarterly quota’s&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
