&lt;li&gt;Develop short and long-term growth and renewal strategies across your customer base&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance tactical execution whilst ultimately targeting complex, high-value solution-based deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively develop unsolicited proposals that align with customer initiatives and position Smartsheet as an enterprise software solution provider&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accurately forecast sales opportunities, while tracking and using critical metrics that predict sales success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform other duties as assigned.&lt;/li&gt;
