&lt;li&gt;Proven Sales Expertise: 1-3 years of progressive sales experience, with a strong track record of success in the software or technology sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Account Management: Demonstrated ability to manage and expand relationships within accounts in a B2B environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Thinking and Problem-Solving: Ability to analyze complex client needs, develop strategic solutions, and navigate challenging sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional Presence and Communication: Exceptional written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to effectively engage and influence C-level executives. B2 English Proficiency Level or higher.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Acumen: Passion for technology and the ability to quickly grasp complex technical concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
