&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of experience in a technical field such as training, customer success, technical support, or similar roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with a services-centric partner community in B2B Software&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for working with leading-edge, web-based technologies and desire to deeply understand Smartsheet&#39;s benefits, use cases, and business and technical elements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated analytical, organizational, and project management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to succeed in a fast-paced, dynamic, and high-growth technology environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High motivation and self-starter mentality; excellent at follow-up and delivering within defined timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and presentation skills (written and verbal) with the ability to explain technical subjects to non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience crafting engaging training materials and partner communications, and applying engagement strategies to drive partner participation and knowledge retention&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
