&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid position with occasional travel to Sofia. You will report to the Sr. Manager, People Partnerships who is based in the UK&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
