&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For over 20 years, Smartsheet has empowered teams to manage work seamlessly and scale solutions smarter. Now, in our most ambitious chapter yet, we are uniting human teams with AI agents. By orchestrating the work agents do best, automating manual tasks and uncovering insights at scale, we create the space for people to focus on what truly matters: judgment, creativity, and big thinking. That is magic at work, and it’s what we show up for every day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Social Media Manager to help us grow and deepen Smartsheet&#39;s presence across organic social channels. This is a hands-on, execution-focused role for someone who&#39;s equally comfortable building a content calendar, writing sharp copy, and digging into performance data to figure out what&#39;s working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work closely with our social team and the broader Digital organization, partnering with Creative, Campaigns, Comms, and Product Marketing to bring Smartsheet&#39;s brand voice to life on LinkedIn, X, Instagram, Facebook, and other emerging platforms. You&#39;ll also support influencer relationships and occasional social boosting efforts as part of a broader integrated approach. You will report to the VP of Digital Demand Marketing, based in North America.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content Creation and Channel Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan, write, and publish organic social content across LinkedIn, X, Instagram, and Facebook, with an eye toward both brand storytelling and demand generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and manage the social content calendar, ensuring consistent cadence, timely execution, and alignment with broader marketing campaigns and launches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop platform-specific content that reflects Smartsheet’s voice — clear, confident, and customer-centric — while adapting format and tone for each channel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Creative to brief and produce visual assets, video content, and copy that performs across formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Performance and Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track, analyze, and report on social performance metrics including engagement rate, reach, follower growth, and content-driven pipeline contribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data to identify what’s working, surface insights to the team, and make informed recommendations on content strategy and channel investment.&lt;/li&gt;
