&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For over 20 years, Smartsheet has empowered teams to manage work seamlessly and scale solutions smarter. Now, in our most ambitious chapter yet, we are uniting human teams with AI agents. By orchestrating the work agents do best, automating manual tasks and uncovering insights at scale, we create the space for people to focus on what truly matters: judgment, creativity, and big thinking. That is magic at work, and it’s what we show up for every day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Smartsheet is looking for a Solutions Consultant in Professional Services Delivery to act as a strategic partner for our customers, helping them navigate complex business challenges through an advisory-led approach to professional services. You will help customers rethink their business processes by designing and deploying capabilities that leverage modern automation and AI-native solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead several concurrent projects, moving beyond basic implementation to deeply understand a customer’s core objectives and deliver solutions that drive digital transformation and measurable organizational change. We are looking for a consultant who balances technical execution with a consultative mindset—someone who can manage the details of project delivery while partnering with account teams to identify new opportunities for customer growth and expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to the Manager, Consulting. This is a remote eligible position and you may work remotely from the Eastern region in the US where Smartsheet is registered.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be the Expert in the Room:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead your customers and your cross functional peers through strong business and technical acumen by advising them on best practices that drive measurable value, advising customers to modernize and optimize their workflows across a variety of industries and use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Transformational Engagements:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with customers to design and implement strategic solutions, leveraging a broad range of Smartsheet capabilities to drive organizational change and maximize long-term value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design Modern Solutions:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead in-depth discovery sessions to understand business challenges and design custom solutions that incorporate AI-native functionalities and best-in-class automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Iterate and Build:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop Smartsheet solutions through prototyping and iterative sprints, incorporating frequent customer feedback to ensure the final product meets complex business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Validate and Quality Test:&lt;/strong&gt; Review solution designs through internal testing and facilitate user acceptance testing with stakeholders to ensure deliverable accuracy and depth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage Project Outcomes:&lt;/strong&gt; Take full ownership of project delivery, including timeline, deliverables, scope, and budget, while taking a proactive approach to mitigating risks in partnership with the customer team, internal project team, and internal account team.&lt;/li&gt;
