&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with UX and Product teams to incorporate learnings from research on retention and product adoption into engagement strategy and execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement testing and continuous improvement processes to maximize program impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as primary liaison with key partners to ensure seamless alignment with program launches and overall&amp;nbsp; business strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
